OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands pride a day of
OL,4,A'self love'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA colourful day of events in Guernsey
OL,7,Fhas marked the second Channel Islands
OL,8,FPride event.
OL,10,FChannel Islands pride took place on
OL,11,FSaturday at La Vallette Bathing Pools,
OL,12,Frather than its previous Guernsey base
OL,13,Fof Market Square in St Peter Port.
OL,15,FMagenta, a drag queen who attended the
OL,16,Fevent, said: "Pride's important for
OL,17,Feverybody. It's a day of expression and
OL,18,Fself-love... and be proud of who you
OL,19,Fare and where you're from."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
