OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands pride a day of
OL,4,A'self love'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllie Jones, Pride director and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of LGBTQ+ charity Liberate,
OL,8,Fsaid the event was about "solidarity"
OL,9,Fand coming together. The day included a
OL,10,FPride march, a 50m (164ft) rainbow flag
OL,11,Fand entertainment.
